{"id":"la_stima","lemma":"lástima","pos":"noun","rank":1190,"glosses":["pity"],"ipa":"/ˈlastima/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"lástimas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-l%C3%A1stima.wav","examples":[{"text":"No me digas que sientes lástima de mí.","en":"Don't tell me you feel sorry for me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687852","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to seat","l":"sentar"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"me"}],"phrases":[[0,3,"you don't say"]]},{"text":"Eso es una lástima.","en":"That's too bad.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441139","words":[null,null,{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"that's it"]]},{"text":"Ella tuvo lástima por él.","en":"She took pity on him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453767","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"he"}]},{"text":"Es una lástima que no puedas venir.","en":"It is a pity you cannot come.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/641958","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to come"}]},{"text":"¡Qué lástima que usted no haya venido anoche!","en":"It's a pity you didn't come last night.","words":[{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"you (formal)"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"beech, beech tree"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"last night"}]}]}